# 55QNED85AUA, the US 55-inch QNED85: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W25H 33.31.68.01).
# The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/), from W25H's own generators
# (host/tools/research/model-config.py): hw-option-gen decodes K24N, countryType US, 2G, LCD, UD,
# EPI, 60 Hz panel and SoC output, 1920x1080 graphics; nyx-option-gen ATSC. countryGrp 2: configd's
# USA RMM grpCode. tvregion ATSC: the broadcast system. chip=K24N is the literal of W25H's U-Boot
# (boot.pak). ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this line (the same for the US and
# European lines), with the QNED85/55" panelInch and toolType of the firmware's factory tables.
# Identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200000004002000
ToolOpt=68375503:1323030:1673241:65:24782131:1645463051
modelName=55QNED85AUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=K24N
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
